 "quests": {
  "1656-progress": {
   "build": "70374",
   "class": "Warrior",
   "differs": null,
   "event": "progress",
   "isObject": null,
   "mapID": 1412,
   "name": "Innkeeper Kauth",
   "npc": "6747",
   "questID": 1656,
   "race": "Tauren",
   "sex": "m",
   "source": "community",
   "text": "Yes, young one? What can Kauth do for you?\n\nThe journey here from the Mesa can be a tremendous burden for some, but a welcome sight for others. Which is it for you, I wonder?",
   "time": 1792006042,
   "title": "A Task Unfinished",
   "wanted": null,
   "zone": "Mulgore"
  },
  "3091-progress": {
   "build": "70374",
   "class": "Warrior",
   "differs": null,
   "event": "progress",
   "isObject": null,
   "mapID": 1412,
   "name": "Harutt Thunderhorn",
   "npc": "3059",
   "questID": 3091,
   "race": "Tauren",
   "sex": "m",
   "source": "community",
   "text": "Ah, at last, you've arrived, $c. I did not lie in my note, $N. We are a special breed also, not unlike the druids or shamans of our tribe. You are just as important. We are the ones called upon to defend our borders, to hunt the centaur, and to go to war.",
   "time": 1792001041,
   "title": "Simple Note",
   "wanted": null,
   "zone": "Mulgore"
  },
  "3376-progress": {
   "build": "70374",
   "class": "Warrior",
   "differs": null,
   "event": "progress",
   "isObject": null,
   "mapID": 1412,
   "name": "Brave Windfeather",
   "npc": "3209",
   "questID": 3376,
   "race": "Tauren",
   "sex": "m",
   "source": "community",
   "text": "Sharptusk will trouble us no more once you have brought me proof of his death.  It is his head that I seek, $N.\n\nWe $r live for the hunt, and there is no greater hunt than against one that is cunning enough to perhaps hunt us back.  If you are successful in this task, young one, you will start to learn what I mean.",
   "time": 1792004997,
   "title": "Break Sharptusk!",
   "wanted": null,
   "zone": "Mulgore"
  },
  "747-progress": {
   "build": "70374",
   "class": "Warrior",
   "differs": null,
   "event": "progress",
   "isObject": null,
   "mapID": 1412,
   "name": "Grull Hawkwind",
   "npc": "2980",
   "questID": 747,
   "race": "Tauren",
   "sex": "m",
   "source": "community",
   "text": "Providing meat and feathers for the tribe is the first step in proving yourself as a hunter before the Chief.",
   "time": 1792000625,
   "title": "The Hunt Begins",
   "wanted": null,
   "zone": "Mulgore"
  },
  "750-progress": {
   "build": "70374",
   "class": "Warrior",
   "differs": null,
   "event": "progress",
   "isObject": null,
   "mapID": 1412,
   "name": "Grull Hawkwind",
   "npc": "2980",
   "questID": 750,
   "race": "Tauren",
   "sex": "m",
   "source": "community",
   "text": "If you can provide pelts for the tribe I will pass word along to my father, Chief Hawkwind, of your generous deeds.",
   "time": 1792002659,
   "title": "The Hunt Continues",
   "wanted": null,
   "zone": "Mulgore"
  },
  "753-progress": {
   "build": "70374",
